@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>(0)</b>"

' --- STILE VISIVO ---
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBackgroundColor White
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor White
    ParticipantFontName Helvetica
    ParticipantFontSize 14
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    BoxFontSize 16
    BoxFontColor White
}

' --- DEFINIZIONE LAYERS E PARTECIPANTI ---
box "Simulation Layer (The World Engine)" #4A90E2
    participant "World State" as World
    participant "Sense Interface" as Sense
    participant "Rules Oracle" as Oracle
end box

box "Data Layer" #95A5A6
    database "Log Repository" as DB
end box

box "Cognitive Layer (The Brain)" #27AE60
    participant "Nation Agent\n(Cabinet)" as Agent
end box

' --- INIZIO FLUSSO ---

== Phase 1: Sense==

' 1. DATI REAL-TIME (Dalla RAM)
World -> Sense : Fetch **Current State**
note left
  - Voronoi Graph (Topology)
  - Resources & Budget
  - Current Trust Matrix
end note

activate Sense

' 2. DATI STORICI (Dal DB) - NUOVO!
Sense -> DB : Query **Recent History**
note right
  - "Last 5 turns summary"
  - "Active Grievances"
  (Context window optimization)
end note

' 3. FUSIONE
Sense -> Sense : **Synthesize Intelligence**


' 4. INPUT FINALE
Sense -> Agent : <b>Inject Strategic Context</b>
note right
  Complete report for LLMs
end note
deactivate Sense

== Phase 2: Think==

activate Agent
Agent -> Agent : <b>Cabinet Deliberation</b>
note right of Agent
  Multi-Agent system computes:
  1. Each Minister propose action
  2. Public opinion poll
  3. President balances actions
end note

Agent -> Oracle : <b>Submit Diplomatic Envelope</b>
note right
  Contains <b>Multi-Payload</b>:
  - Military Vector of actions (Priority List)
  - Economic action
  - Foreign policy action
end note
deactivate Agent

== Phase 3: Act (Validation & Execution) ==

activate Oracle

' --- VALIDAZIONE SEQUENZIALE LINEARE ---
Oracle -> Oracle : <b>1. Assess Social Reaction</b>
note right
  Calculate impact on satisfaction.
end note

Oracle -> Oracle : <b>2. Validate Budget & Physics</b>
note right
  - Verify if budget allows it
  - Verify pathfinding & topology
end note

Oracle -> World : <b>Execute State Changes</b>
note left: Modify world state:\nborders, resources, trust levels

== Phase 4: Trace==

Oracle -> DB : <b>Archive Turn Data</b>
note right: Saves worlds snapshot and actions taken for\nfuture analysis

World -> World : Advance Turn
deactivate Oracle

@enduml